  "request": "#931 w39 · create a spec from a go idea with its handoff and a link back (P3).\nProblem: Create spec from idea sends only the title and one rationale paragraph, though a go decision carries a handoff block written for exactly this step. Afterwards the idea and its spec lose each other, so neither page can point at the other.\nProposed: The create-spec action in apps/vscode/src/features/processes/processActions.ts passes the handoff fields to specify, and the new spec's record keeps the assessment path through apps/speckit-extension/scripts/write-context.py, so the viewer links back to the idea and the idea page links to the spec.\nAcceptance: The specify prompt carries every handoff field. The new spec's record names the idea's folder. Each page links to the other.\nOwner: \"lets do them and reword\".",
